      },
      "message": "feat(ui): viewport hover over a picked feature marks its Geometry-tab row\n\nThe pointer over a picked face, chain or vertex in the viewport outlines\nthat pick's row in the Geometry tab and records it in State.geo_row_marked\n(ephemeral, cleared each frame, no command). The reverse of #1507.\n\nRefs #1507\nFixes #1519\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
